# Complete product blueprint: College assessment SaaS platform

Based on everything we've discussed, I recommend building this as a multi-college online assessment platform, with Django as the main backend, React as the frontend, PostgreSQL as the primary database, and Google Drive integration for faculty-owned documents and reports.

The goal is to create one reliable platform where colleges can conduct examinations, assess students, review results, monitor potential malpractice, and compare their performance with other colleges.

I'll organize this into features, how each feature should work, recommended technologies, and the development instructions. This can become the foundation for your eventual master prompt for an AI coding model or development team.

