### How it should work

Step 1 — Connect Google Drive

Faculty clicks `Connect Google Drive`.

The application opens Google's OAuth consent screen. Faculty signs in using their own Google account and authorizes the required access.

Step 2 — Create faculty folder

The application creates a folder structure in that faculty member's Drive.

Example:

