### Why Django instead of FastAPI as the main backend?

| Requirement                      | Django                | FastAPI                       |
| -------------------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| User authentication              | Built in              | Requires additional setup     |
| Admin panel                      | Built in              | Requires additional setup     |
| Database ORM                     | Built in              | Usually SQLAlchemy or similar |
